    "rich_text_Fi99hW": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_8TwVYn": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "a deep dive into shamballa jewels",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_qPgprk": {
          "type": "text",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>Simplicity in Design</strong><br/>Our Solid Bracelets are characterized by their clean and simple lines, offering an elegant and modern expression. <br/>The minimalist design makes them versatile and perfect for both everyday wear and special occasions. Whether worn alone or stacked with other bracelets, a Solid Bracelet adds a touch of luxury to your style.<br/><br/><strong>Highest Quality Materials</strong><br/>We use only the finest materials for our Solid Bracelets, including 18-karat gold, rose gold, white gold, and black rhodinated gold. Every detail is meticulously crafted to ensure durability and an unparalleled shine. These bracelets are designed to last for many years, making them a valuable addition to any jewelry collection.<br/><br/><strong>Adorned with Diamonds and Precious Stones</strong><br/>Our Solid Bracelets can be embellished with white or black diamonds, as well as other precious stones that add an extra level of luxury. The sparkling diamonds provide an elegant luster, while the colorful gemstones offer a personal touch. Each Solid Bracelet thus becomes a unique piece that reflects your individual style.<br/><br/><strong>Perfect for Everyone</strong><br/>Our Solid Bracelets cater to both women and men who desire to wear exclusive and timeless jewelry. Whether you’re looking for a sleek accessory for daily wear or a striking statement piece for a special occasion, you will find the perfect choice in our collection.<br/><br/><strong>Explore Shamballa Jewels</strong><br/>We invite you to explore our collection of Solid Bracelets in our store in Copenhagen or online. Our dedicated team is ready to assist you in finding the ideal bracelet. Discover the unique beauty and quality of Shamballa Jewels’ Solid Bracelets and add a piece of luxury to your jewelry collection.</p>"
          }
        },
